# Enquiry spam fix — shipped (ops follow-up)

Code is in place. To fully enable Cloudflare Turnstile in production:

1. Create a Turnstile widget at https://dash.cloudflare.com → Turnstile
2. Set on **Vercel (frontend)**: `NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=<site key>`
3. Set on **Lightsail API (backend)**: `TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=<secret key>`
4. Redeploy frontend + restart backend (`pm2 restart sarveda-backend`)

Until keys are set: honeypot, timing, IP/email rate limits, thread dedupe, and content heuristics still protect the inbox. Turnstile verify is skipped when the secret is absent.

## What shipped
- Rate limit: 5 creates / 15 min / IP on enquiry + contact create routes
- Honeypot (`website`) + min 2s form timing (required in production)
- Optional Turnstile (required when secret is configured)
- Dedupe: same email + source OPEN thread within 7 days → append message
- Email caps: 8 customer messages / hour; 5 new threads / day
- Newsletter no longer falls back to `/api/contact/support` (no fake chats)
